  abilityName: Radiant Moonlight
  abilityDesc: 33 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    boosts Atk, Def relative to max HP for 3 turns, boosts max HP, damage taken fills
    BB gauge for 3 turns, damage taken restores HP for 3 turns & probable KO resistance
    for 999 turns
